@startuml
title DR-01 · CU-01 Quote cart — preliminary BCE responsibilities
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 75
skinparam ranksep 90

actor "Shopper" as ACT_Shopper
boundary "Quote request\nport" as B_Quote
control "Check Cart\nrequest" as C_CheckRequest
control "Resolve trusted\ncatalog values" as C_ResolveCatalog
control "Total\nCart lines" as C_Total
control "Check Coupon\neligibility" as C_CheckCoupon
control "Apply selected\ndiscount" as C_Discount
control "Complete\nPriceQuote" as C_Complete
control "Return\nrefusal" as C_Refuse #LightCoral
entity "Cart" as E_Cart
entity "CartLine" as E_CartLine
entity "Product" as E_Product
entity "Coupon" as E_Coupon #LightBlue
entity "PriceQuote" as E_PriceQuote

ACT_Shopper -- B_Quote : 1 request\n7 result/refusal
B_Quote -- C_CheckRequest : 1-2 request\nFE-01
C_CheckRequest -- E_Cart : 2 nonempty
C_CheckRequest -- E_CartLine : 2 quantity
C_CheckRequest -- C_ResolveCatalog : 3 Product codes
C_CheckRequest -- C_Refuse : FE-01
C_ResolveCatalog -- E_Product : 3 trusted price\nFE-02 / FE-03
C_ResolveCatalog -- E_Coupon : 5 trusted Coupon\nFA-01 / FA-02\nFE-04
C_ResolveCatalog -- C_Refuse : FE-02 / FE-03 / FE-04
C_ResolveCatalog -- C_Total : 4
C_Total -- E_CartLine : 4 lines
C_Total -- E_Product : 4 cents
C_Total -- C_CheckCoupon : 5 subtotal
C_CheckCoupon -- E_Coupon : FA-01 / FA-02\nconfiguration and eligibility
C_CheckCoupon -- C_Refuse : FE-05 / FE-06 / FE-07
C_CheckCoupon -- C_Discount : 5; FA-01..FA-03
C_Discount -- C_Complete : 6 amounts
C_Complete -- E_PriceQuote : 6
C_Complete -- B_Quote : 7 PriceQuote
C_Refuse -- B_Quote : FE-01..FE-07\nreason, no quote

note bottom of B_Quote
  Machine interface: no invented GUI.
  Client supplies codes/quantities, CNY, optional code and explicit UTC instant.
  A client price has no authoritative input field.
end note
note bottom of E_Product
  Product and Coupon values come from the internal
  trusted server-side catalog snapshot.
  Trust does not waive configuration validation.
end note
legend bottom
  Flow text: 1 submit; 2 check request; 3 resolve trusted Product;
  4 total lines; 5 choose discount; 6 complete PriceQuote; 7 return.
  FA-01 valid fixed; FA-02 valid percentage; FA-03 zero subtotal.
  FE-01 invalid request; FE-02 unknown Product; FE-03 invalid Product;
  FE-04 unknown Coupon; FE-05 expired; FE-06 minimum; FE-07 invalid Coupon.
  All paths are read-only. Failure produces no successful PriceQuote.
  Edges show communication responsibilities, not time or method calls.
endlegend
@enduml
